# Cloudflare Pages headers. Default asset caching is max-age=14400 (4h), which
# made redeploys invisible — the browser kept serving stale JS modules. Force
# every asset to revalidate each load (etag → cheap 304 when unchanged, 200 with
# new content on a deploy), so deploys propagate immediately. Fine at this scale;
# revisit with hashed filenames if the app ever grows.
/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
